flowchart TD
    A([Model requests RepoMap]) --> B[Decode unique JSON object]
    B --> C{Path resolves inside canonical workspace?}
    C -->|No| X[Typed content-free denial]
    C -->|Yes| D[Common catalog permission and routing checks]
    D --> E[Walk recognized source files without following links]
    E --> F[Skip hidden generated dependency recovery and state trees]
    F --> G{Declaration signatures requested?}
    G -->|No| H[Collect relative source paths]
    G -->|Yes| I[Parse names and type shapes without bodies or values]
    H --> J[Sort deterministically]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Apply candidate file symbol signature and 64 KiB bounds]
    K --> L([Bounded repository map result])
    L --> M[Profiler verifies one real call and declaration marker]
